# A closed loft: loft_ring.tlspr's smooth loft through six circles round
# the z axis, its screen shown from the group list, closed into a ring
# by [closed] on its last row; the screen, then the solid checked, a
# ring with no caps; undo opens it again.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 407 330
twdown L 407 330
twup L 407 330
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
key z ctrl
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
